# Line endings: every text file is LF in checkouts on every platform (the CI runner and new worktrees use core.autocrlf=true,
# and Vitest cannot transform CRLF .mjs files - release run 39444944536). Binaries are never touched.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.db binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.gguf binary
*.zip binary
*.asar binary
*.bin binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.webp binary
*.pak binary
*.dat binary
